{"id":"660741","name":"当归生姜羊肉汤","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/660741/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊排骨","amount":"3根"}],"sub":[{"name":"当归","amount":"3片"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"2根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"羊肉排骨洗净放在小锅里。","img":"images/660741/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入2碗水烧开把羊肉焯一下。","img":"images/660741/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出过一下开水倒掉。","img":"images/660741/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"砂锅里倒入开水放入羊排。","img":"images/660741/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取当归2片干姜2片冲洗干净。","img":"images/660741/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入砂锅里开小火慢炖。","img":"images/660741/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"胡萝卜根洗干净去皮。","img":"images/660741/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切成小块备用。","img":"images/660741/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放进砂锅内继续炖熟为止关火放香菜。","img":"images/660741/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/660741/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}